{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10283090","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10283090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1028309001:1":{"text":"あら、あなたたち。まだあまり歩き回らない方がいいわよ。みんな今も不安がってるからねぇ……","source_cn":"是你们啊。唉，最近还是别到处乱跑，大伙都人心惶惶的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2032FDF313A1CCCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028309002:1":{"text":"こんにちは、おばあさん。実は、薬用植物についてお話を聞きたくて……","source_cn":"您好，尊敬的长者，我们只是想来问一些和药用植物有关的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC32DFA484973322E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028309003:1":{"text":"薬用植物？それなら私に聞くといいわ。ここの花茶はどれも私が自分で採って調合したのよ。","source_cn":"药用植物？这你们可问对人了。这些花茶都是我亲自采摘配制...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F66F06ABF922E32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028309004:0":{"text":"一杯いかが？","source_cn":"你们要不要来一杯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF760917985CB9663","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028309005:1":{"text":"ぜひぜひ！いただきます……\nぬおっ！おお！おおおー！！","source_cn":"好啊好啊！让我试试……\\n哇哦！哇哦哇哦哇哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F50EB4CD972F65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1028309005":{"text":"ぜひぜひ！いただきます……\nぬおっ！おお！おおおー！！","source_cn":"好啊好啊！让我试试……\\n哇哦！哇哦哇哦哇哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F50EB4CD972F65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028309006:1":{"text":"なんて芳しい香り！一杯飲んだだけで、魂が抜けそうになったというか、まるで童心に戻ったような、喜びに満ちあふれる感じです！","source_cn":"真——香啊！这么一杯下去，感觉我的灵魂都要飞上天，像是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E0E79006F899363","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028309007:1":{"text":"なんて不思議な感覚！ご老人！このお茶は若返りの効果でもあるんですか！？","source_cn":"天啊，老人家，你这茶不会能让人返老还童吧？！太神奇了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC36C6714A43FD8E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028309008:1":{"text":"ほっほっ、嬉しいねぇ。でも本当にそんな効果があるなら、私もこんな老いぼれになってないわよ。","source_cn":"哈哈，多谢你的称赞，要真能像你说的那样，我怎么还会是现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05CB42ED777F558D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028309009:1":{"text":"さて、どの「薬用植物」について聞きたいのかしら？","source_cn":"好啦，年轻人，你们要找我问的“药用植物”是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6840B52D84189CB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1028309009":{"text":"さて、どの「薬用植物」について聞きたいのかしら？","source_cn":"好啦，年轻人，你们要找我问的“药用植物”是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6840B52D84189CB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028309010:1":{"text":"ああ、それらの植物なら全部この近くに生えてるわよ。摘んで一日以内が一番効果がいいの。","source_cn":"哦，这几种植物大部分都在附近能找到，采摘后一日内，效果最佳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63B84B935D6108FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028309011:1":{"text":"そうそう、新鮮な魔力の若葉はマナシードからしか採れないからね。でもあの子たちは逃げ足が速いからねぇ……","source_cn":"啊对了，你们要记住，新鲜的魔力嫩芽只能在魔花种子上采集...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F363F0F70AB726A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028309012:1":{"text":"ああ、それと、あなたたちが探している植物はどれも薬草よ。効果も様々だから、くれぐれもむやみに食べちゃだめよ！","source_cn":"还有还有，你们问的那些植物都是药草，药性复杂，可不敢随...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x604699F59419BC3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028309013:1":{"text":"病人がいるのなら、まずはお医者さんに処方箋を書いてもらいなさい……","source_cn":"要是有人生病的话，记得要先去找医师开药方……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50A71D8F3C3583F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028309014:1":{"text":"分かりました。ありがとうございます、おばあさん！","source_cn":"知道了！谢谢您，老人家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9F21DFFFC9B8B26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"（「霊薬」が生えている場所を聞く）","source_cn":"询问“灵药”的植物位置","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x97027E49D0E596A3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（「霊薬」が生えている場所を聞く）","female":"（「霊薬」が生えている場所を聞く）","variant_male_record_index":"61276","variant_female_record_index":"61277","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"どうかな？","source_cn":"怎么样？<key:dialog3>","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x63778B0091313085","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"どうかな？","female":"どうかしら？","variant_male_record_index":"61274","variant_female_record_index":"61275","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:喝茶的老者":{"text":"お茶を飲んでいる老人","source":"喝茶的老者","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"クイン","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":3}}